.TH start-cli-backup-target-remove 1  "remove "
.SH NAME
start\-cli\-backup\-target\-remove \- Remove a backup target; deletes the data of a local target
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBstart\-cli backup target remove\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIID\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove a backup target; deletes the data of a local target
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIID\fR>
Backup target identifier
